# The M1 xylophone with accent LEDs: 9 LEDs, 20% at most, 80 ms flashes.
# A flash is color x 20% x velocity / 127 per channel, rounded down, and never dark.
body ../../bodies/m1-xylophone-accent.hex
# #FF4000 at 127: 255 x 0.2 = 51 (33), 64 x 0.2 = 12 (0C)
0 on 72 127 struck 30 #330C00
79 is-lit 72 yes
80 is-lit 72 no
# #FFC000 at 100: 40 (28), 30 (1E)
100 on 74 100 struck 26 #281E00
# at velocity 1 every lit channel rounds to 0, so it shows 1: dim, never dark
200 on 72 1 struck 12 #010100
# refused notes don't flash
300 on 72 127 struck 30 #330C00
300 on 74 127 struck 30 #332600
300 on 76 127 polyphony
300 is-lit 76 no
# panic darkens everything
310 panic
310 is-lit 72 no
310 is-lit 74 no
